@startuml LMS_Arch_03_Repository
title Architecture 3: Repository Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

database "CENTRAL LMS REPOSITORY\n(PostgreSQL / SQLite)\n\n• BookTitle\n• BookCopy\n• Patron\n• BorrowTransaction\n• Reservation\n• BorrowingRules" as Repo #FCE4EC

rectangle "Catalog ISBN Tool\n(API Fetcher)" as Tool_ISBN #E3F2FD
rectangle "Reserve Tool\n(FCFS Queue Manager)" as Tool_Reserve #E8F5E9
rectangle "Search Tool\n(Catalog & Locator)" as Tool_Search #E8F5E9
rectangle "Report Generator\n(Overdue & Popular CSV)" as Tool_Report #FFF9C4
rectangle "Email Notifier\n(SMTP Reminders)" as Tool_Email #FFF9C4
rectangle "Issue / Return Tool\n(Circulation Engine)" as Tool_Circulation #FFE0B2
rectangle "Fine Calculator" as Tool_Fine #FFE0B2

Tool_ISBN -down-> Repo : Writes Catalog
Tool_Reserve <-down-> Repo : Reads / Writes Queue
Tool_Search -left-> Repo : Queries Titles
Tool_Report -left-> Repo : Reads Statistics
Tool_Email -left-> Repo : Reads Dues
Tool_Circulation <-up-> Repo : Reads Eligibility / Records Loans
Tool_Fine -up-> Tool_Circulation : Computes Fine
Tool_Circulation -up-> Repo : Updates Fines

note top of Repo
  **Repository Pattern:**
  All tools communicate strictly via
  the shared repository — no direct
  tool-to-tool connections.
end note

@enduml
